<title>UK: Royal Sun hit by U.S. reserving, currency.</title>
<headline>Royal Sun hit by U.S. reserving, currency.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		29.7		   vs 52.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 19.0		   vs 16.3</p>
<p> Life pretax		213		    vs 185</p>
<p> General pretax	   480		    vs 754</p>
<p> Operating profits	706		    vs 915</p>
<p> Pretax		     648		    vs 1,031</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 828 and 926 million stg. The figures included an exceptional charge of 167 milion stg mainly relating to a change in reserving for U.S. environmental liabilities and the 32 million stg impact of currency movements.</p>
<p>Full company name - Royal &amp; Sun Alliance Insurance Group Plc</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
